<title>UK: UK meal and feeds mixed on quiet market.</title>
<headline>UK meal and feeds mixed on quiet market.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK meals and feeds prices were mixed on a tradeless market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;People can see Chicago falling and buyers see no reason why they should buy right now,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal was offered five stg down to one stg up while Brazilian 48's were around two stg up.</p>
<p>Rapemeal sellers were one to two stg down while the remainder of the market was unchanged.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
